        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chino nicho chilomo cha Nehemia okhwa Hakalia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilinana lia Nehemia khu Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwesi kwe Kisilefu, mu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kabili naba mu lukoba luboofu lwa Susa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanani, mulala khu bawandaayase ola khukhwama e Yuda alala ne sipupu sie babaandu be siseecha babaandi. Ne abareeba khuloondekhana ne Yerusalemu ne khu Bayuda babaona khukhwama mu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "khukhwama mu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "baba bakobola khukhwama mu mbaambe, namwe se bayilwa mu mbaambe tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mbaambe e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamboolela bali, “Abo babarama mu lukoongo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mu lukoongo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "baba baona embaambe namwe barama mu lukoba lwabwe ne se bacha mu mbaambe tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " babelukha embaambe bali mu butinyu bukali ne chisoni. Lisiisi lia Yerusalemu liatechukha; ne bilibwa biayo bionakwa ne kumulilo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne naulila kamakhuwa kano, nekhala asi mala nalila. Nalila khu ndaalo chingali. Nachilila khusila khulia ne khusaba ebweeni wa Wele owe mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naloma ndi, “Ee, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe mwikulu, Wele Omukali lundi owe khuukia, ewe oliinda endakaano yowo ne khuba ne busiime bwa buli lwoosi khwaabo ba baakhusiima ne khuliinda kamalaka kowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekeeresia mala obone, lisaba lio omukholi wowo nilio ndikho esaba ebweeni wowo siilo ne kumuusi. Esabila bakholi bowo, babaandu ba Isiraeli. Niyama bumayaanu bwefwe nibwo khwakhukholela. Ee, ese ne be nju yefwe khwakholile bumayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwakhukholele kamamayaanu lukali. Se khwaliinda kamalaka niko walaka omukholi wowo Musa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 26.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khebulila niko walaka omukholi wowo Musa oli, ‘Enywe mwalekha khuba babeyikinwa ta, nja khumusalanisia mu kholo chichiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.1+DEU.30.2+DEU.30.3+DEU.30.4+DEU.30.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 30.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali mwaba ne mungalukhila mala muliinde kamalaka kase nja khumukobosia abuundu niio narobora khukhunjisaayilao, mwakhaba ne mwasalanila mwiloba lioosi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bali bakholi bowo, lundi babaandu bowo nibo ewe wasikula ne bunyali bwowo bukali, ne kamaani kowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, rekeeresia lisaba lio mukholi wowo, ne lisaba lie bakholi bowo babasiima khuba ne buriaani khwiwe. Ana bukhili khu mukholi wowo, mala okhole omwami akholele siisa.” Nono ese naba omusuti owe sikoombe sio omwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
